# Up takes a steer back while a command runs: the command sleeps four
# seconds; a prompt sent meanwhile waits as `┋ <prompt>`; Up at the empty
# composer takes it back into the composer (steer-up), it is edited and sent
# again (steer-again), and the turn tells the model the edited words after
# the command's result (steer-done; gwlog). fx's e2e
# `tui-interrupt-recovery.test.ts:393`.
fx: gateway interrupt-steer-retract-fx.json
xfx: gateway interrupt-steer-retract-xfx.json
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
wait 2
type run it
key Enter
wait 1.2
type change tone
key Enter
wait 0.4
snap steer-wait
key Up
wait 0.4
snap steer-up
type  and keep it short
key Enter
wait 0.4
snap steer-again
wait 5
snap steer-done
gwlog
